  class lg0 blue
  class lg1 orange
  class lg2 tan
  class lg3 yellow
  class lg4 breaks
  class lg5 bugPath
  s0: No calls yet
  s1: Stopped before any call
  s2: Calls saved
  s3: Process died before the read
  s4: Read in flight
  s5: Same pending read resumed
  s6: Read result stored
  s7: Confirm card open
  s8: Write confirmed
  s9: Second confirm stored
  s10: Model requested
  s11: Crashed after the model
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: the job stops before any call
  s0 --> s2: the turn is saved
  s2 --> s3: the process dies before the read
  s2 --> s4: the saved read runs
  s3 --> s5: the same pending call resumes
  s4 --> s6: the read result is stored
  s5 --> s4: the saved read runs
  s6 --> s7: the confirm card opens
  s7 --> s8: the write is confirmed
  s8 --> s9: the write is confirmed again
  s9 --> s10: the model is requested
  s10 --> s11: the process dies after the model
